{"id": "69395", "title": "擒鸟", "author": "了了是我", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 20, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69395.htm", "intro": "苏袅袅这辈子最不想见到的人就是邹秦，可命运就像是跟她开了一个天大的玩笑，她以为她离他更远，其实反而离他更近。\n    邹秦伸出手：“袅袅过来……”\n    “不……”苏袅袅摇摇头，向后退了一大步。\n    “过来……”邹秦又向前走了一大步。\n    “不……”苏袅袅又向后退了一大步。\n    “啊……”一声尖叫，再次睁开眼睛，苏袅袅已经掉进一个网里。\n    “没关系……”邹秦笑着收起网：“前面是我，后面是网，你怎么也跑不了……”\n    内容标签： 都市情缘 春风一度 高干", "base": "files/article/html/69/69395", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10641958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "章节目录", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10620164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10641959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10641960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10641961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-35", "file": "10641962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10641963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10641964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10641965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10641966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10641967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10620165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-67完结", "file": "10641968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10620166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10620167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10620168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10620169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-35", "file": "10620170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10620171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10620172.html", "available": false}]}